Local mathematical extraction of the original FAIR-Unipd DSC-MRI toolbox,
including its published SVD-family baselines and leakage-regression convention.
Original authors/copyright and MIT license are preserved in LICENSE.

Two independently diagnosed mathematical source defects are explicitly
qualified: baseline column-major slice stride and the missing oSVD inverse-time
factor. Other source conventions and negative estimates are retained. This is
not a claim of unchanged reproduction or stable-spline implementation.

The complete real GRE observations and external arterial curve were supplied
in the original author repository. No separate data redistribution grant was
identified. No independent Creative Commons grant or patient-truth accuracy is
invented. This package is prepared for the user's authorized local research;
public redistribution rights for original observations remain unresolved.

Exact source revision, paper versions, modifications, failed and successful
native executions, data hashes and private archive index are documented in
test/validation.md. Full upstream source and papers remain private.
